::notes

For the source's vegetarian alternative, replace beef with 500g fake meat and a 19oz can of lentils, drained and washed.
The recipe may be doubled and frozen for lunches.
Optionally brown 1/2 cup sliced mushrooms with the onions in the beef layer.
The corn layer may be replaced with diced vegetables such as black radishes, parsnips, carrots, turnips and/or cauliflower.

